<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Results ‣ Wan-Animate-2: Pushing the Application Boundaries of Character Animation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>User Study</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5 Results ‣ Wan-Animate-2: Pushing the Application Boundaries of Character Animation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Real-Time Inference</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
